osition\":\"active\",\"evidence\":\"readme-probes.txt:3 records the git-preflight README request topping sk-doc; stage two then scores only README_CREATION=12, so hook-readme-template.md does not load. 'write a hook mirror readme' scores README_CREATION=4 only after RUNTIME_PLUGIN_README dropped its phrase, so runtime-plugin-readme-template.md does not load. AC-003 asserts top=sk-doc, while spec.md:61 promises templates.\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:136\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"id\":\"F001\",\"recommendation\":\"Extend the phase probe to assert the leaf pair for git-preflight and hook mirror, or narrow the purpose sentence to hub reach and record the generic fallback.\",\"scopeProof\":\"Scored every declared generic and named hook phrase with the leaf-route-replay rule; retained names still select their specific leaves, only the dropped families fall through.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The accepted probe proves hub reach only, while two dropped phrase families now load the generic README leaves\"},{\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-readme/assets/skill-readme-template.md\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-readme/assets/hook-readme-template.md\"],\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"evidence\":\"'readme for the skill-advisor hook' contains the SKILL_README keyword 'readme for the skill' (ROUTER.md:215), so SKILL_README=16 and HOOK_README=16 are both within one point of the top and both leaf sets load.\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:219\",\"findingClass\":\"instance-only\",\"id\":\"F002\",\"recommendation\":\"Drop the named skill-advisor phrase in favor of the generic hook phrases, or require a word boundary that excludes a hyphenated name after 'skill'.\",\"scopeProof\":\"Scored all 20 'readme for the ... hook' phrases; only skill-advisor produces a second top-score intent.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The named skill-advisor hook phrase ties the skill README and hook README intents\"},{\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/spec.md\",\"039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/tasks.md\",\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-readme/ROUTER.md\"],\"dimension\":\"traceability\",\"disposition\":\"active\",\"evidence\":\"The Files to Change table names .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-readme/ROUTER.md as Modify; tasks.md:46 records 'left as is'; implementation-summary.md:57-63 omits it; git diff --name-only over the commit confirms it is not in the change; the packet router still carries 'security policy' and 'sync.md' at sk-create-readme/ROUTER.md:109.\",\"file\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/spec.md:105\",\"findingClass\":\"matrix/evidence\",\"id\":\"F003\",\"recommendation\":\"Remove the row from the Files to Change table with the recorded reason, or make the narrowing change to the packet router.\",\"scopeProof\":\"Compared spec table, task evidence, implementation-summary table and the commit's file list; the hub router gates advisor entry, so no runtime caller reaches the packet through the dropped phrase.\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"The 039 spec still lists the packet router as a file to change, but the delivered work left it untouched\"}],\"findingsCount\":3,\"findingsNew\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":3},\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":3},\"focus\":\"correctness and traceability - stage-two README intent narrowing and generated-artifact parity\",\"generation\":1,\"graphEvents\":[{\"id\":\"d-correctness\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"correctness\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"d-traceability\",\"kind\":\"DIMENSION\",\"label\":\"traceability\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"file-sk-doc-router\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\":\"file-sk-doc-graph-metadata\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json\",\"type\":\"node\"},{\"id\"