ered `/create:sk-skill` | Fixed: the mention check reads a retired name beside the command it maps to |\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report.md:19:| FIX11-P2-003 | P2 | `lib/command-attach.ts` comment | The comment named only the opening quote | Fixed with FIX11-P1-001 |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"grep -rn \\\"commandOnlyMentioned\\\\|command-attach\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-10.md specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report.md 2>/dev/null | head -40\"}"},"time":{"start":1794857023293,"end":1794857024146}}}}
