he exported function, the fixture rows and the six wrapper pairs.\\n- Required evidence: file:line in the module and the test, plus a concrete prompt whose attached command differs from the plain form.\\n- Recovery note: none.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-12/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794857822274,"end":1794857827052}}}}
