book_capability` | overlay | partial | 1 | No playbook scenario executed; the module was exercised directly with the fixture rows and the uncovered wrappers. |\n153: \n154: <!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n155: ## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n156: \n157: | File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n158: |------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n159: | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` | D1, D3 | 1 | 1 P1, 1 P2 | partial |\n160: | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` | D1, D3 | 1 | 0 | partial |\n161: \n162: ---\n163: \n164: <!-- ANCHOR:review-boundaries -->\n165: ## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n166: \n167: - Max iterations: 8\n168: - Convergence threshold: 0.10\n169: - Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n170: - No-progress threshold: 0.05\n171: - Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n172: - Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-mention-12-1794856957949-n58dw7, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n173: - Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n174: - Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n175: - Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n176: - Severity threshold: P2\n177: - Review target type: spec-folder\n178: - Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n179: - Started: 2026-11-16T19:34:48Z\n180: \n181: <!-- /ANCHOR:review-boundaries -->","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/mention-12/deep-review-strategy.md, lines 1-181\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Review Strategy - command mention pass twelve\n3: description: Runtime strategy for the mention-12 lineage, tracking the commandOnlyMentioned wrapper, quote and alias guards a